{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_0806B03E","title":"Ava Didn't You Forget Something","entry":"Dlg_0806B03E::entry","exit":"Dlg_0806B03E::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_751C7C58","articyId":"72057619807791569","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"So, about Edison and Mica... The Network and Corpsec. We seem to have two options.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So, about Edison and Mica... The Network and Corpsec. We seem to have two options.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":200.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32088","byteOffset":20020456,"byteLength":428}},{"id":"DFr_44B3070D","articyId":"72057821671351022","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"I swam the nets. Edison had a sister. She died and left a daughter behind. The age checks out.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I swam the nets. Edison had a sister. She died and left a daughter behind. The age checks out.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1400.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51465","byteOffset":33885712,"byteLength":404}},{"id":"DFr_8149B8A1","articyId":"72057821671351029","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"And the child was erased from the records a couple of days ago.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"And the child was erased from the records a couple of days ago.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1700.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36210","byteOffset":28045632,"byteLength":444}},{"id":"DFr_69E81316","articyId":"72057821671351050","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Which would probably kill Edison's niece.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Which would probably kill Edison's niece.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":800.0,"y":150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50921","byteOffset":33603584,"byteLength":388}},{"id":"DFr_3ECA2A59","articyId":"72057821671351086","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"She's Corp. No morals is basically her job description.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"She's Corp. No morals is basically her job description.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2300.0,"y":25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38664","byteOffset":28961696,"byteLength":364}},{"id":"DFr_87C69BB4","articyId":"72057821671351093","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"I hate to say I told you so.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I hate to say I told you so.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2300.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39743","byteOffset":29365584,"byteLength":336}},{"id":"DFr_BE13B23F","articyId":"72057821671351107","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Yes, well, I'm only human.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yes, well, I'm only human.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2900.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20917","byteOffset":15796400,"byteLength":336}},{"id":"DFr_B3A113A1","articyId":"72057821671351114","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"He seems to me like a man who is tired of lies and deceit. He is broken.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"He seems to me like a man who is tired of lies and deceit. He is broken.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2300.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17482","byteOffset":14501232,"byteLength":380}},{"id":"DFr_198F53CE","articyId":"72057821671351130","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"I have a solution. It's not certain to succeed. Or likely. And... it may contradict some of the morals I've observed in your actions so far.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I have a solution. It's not certain to succeed. Or likely. And... it may contradict some of the morals I've observed in your actions so far.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3500.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22486","byteOffset":16392744,"byteLength":484}},{"id":"DFr_EF07CBA0","articyId":"72057821671351151","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Mica Rain.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Mica Rain.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4100.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19812","byteOffset":15377696,"byteLength":392}},{"id":"DFr_1FF1C7E8","articyId":"72057821671351180","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Hear me out. I know you. I know you want to help the child. If we don't stop Mica, the niece dies. If we can't find a way to win over Freya, she will never be free.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hear me out. I know you. I know you want to help the child. If we don't stop Mica, the niece dies. If we can't find a way to win over Freya, she will never be free.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4700.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28255","byteOffset":18572480,"byteLength":472}},{"id":"DFr_7A6A9EFE","articyId":"72057821671351201","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"I think Mica has made it clear. She will take everyone down. It's her or us... Unless we roll over and surrender to her.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I think Mica has made it clear. She will take everyone down. It's her or us... Unless we roll over and surrender to her.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":6250.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"52056","byteOffset":34108872,"byteLength":464}},{"id":"DFr_5806F33C","articyId":"72057821671351208","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"I am serious.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I am serious.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4700.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43198","byteOffset":30671720,"byteLength":324}},{"id":"DFr_EC02E29A","articyId":"72057821671351233","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Mica is Freya's most bitter enemy. If we choose The Network over CorpSec, we will make a powerful friend. Give Mica to Freya, and she will give you anything you ask for.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Mica is Freya's most bitter enemy. If we choose The Network over CorpSec, we will make a powerful friend. Give Mica to Freya, and she will give you anything you ask for.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5000.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17161","byteOffset":14381888,"byteLength":516}},{"id":"DFr_573DF9B3","articyId":"72057821671351248","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"It's not like you're pulling the trigger. And it's either Mica goes down, or Edison, his niece, and your business, are all history.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It's not like you're pulling the trigger. And it's either Mica goes down, or Edison, his niece, and your business, are all history.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5600.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33879","byteOffset":20699640,"byteLength":476}},{"id":"DFr_58E57EEA","articyId":"72057821671351286","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Mica is an android, if that helps","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Mica is an android, if that helps","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":7450.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49110","byteOffset":32919664,"byteLength":380}},{"id":"DFr_73F4D7C5","articyId":"72057821671351307","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Let's figure this plan out.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Let's figure this plan out.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":8050.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40198","byteOffset":29538248,"byteLength":336}},{"id":"DFr_075781DF","articyId":"72057821671351323","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"No blood on our hands. Well, not literally. I'll try to locate Edison. Let's tell him what you're up to.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"No blood on our hands. Well, not literally. I'll try to locate Edison. Let's tell him what you're up to.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":8650.0,"y":125.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50506","byteOffset":33448552,"byteLength":412}},{"id":"DFr_C7CE3530","articyId":"72057821671352338","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Are you sure about that? An innocent child? Edison? We give up on them?","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Are you sure about that? An innocent child? Edison? We give up on them?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":6850.0,"y":625.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"34192","byteOffset":20818384,"byteLength":416}},{"id":"DFr_702584A5","articyId":"72057838851065511","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Yes, we only deliver her. Unless... No, no. Let's not kill her ourselves. I'll try to locate Edison.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yes, we only deliver her. Unless... No, no. Let's not kill her ourselves. I'll try to locate Edison.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":8650.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22949","byteOffset":16566328,"byteLength":408}},{"id":"DFr_422B472B","articyId":"72057619807791574","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"We could help Mica destroy The Network and Conland Containers.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"We could help Mica destroy The Network and Conland Containers.","TextSheVersion":"We could help Mica destroy The Network and Conland Containers.","TextTheyVersion":"We could help Mica destroy The Network and Conland Containers."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":500.0,"y":150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27361","byteOffset":18231624,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_7B5042CB","articyId":"72057619807791582","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"We could try to save the child.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"We could try to save the child.","TextSheVersion":"We could try to save the child.","TextTheyVersion":"We could try to save the child."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":500.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22233","byteOffset":16296288,"byteLength":312}},{"id":"DFr_B554F428","articyId":"72057821671351036","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Edison told the truth.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Edison told the truth.","TextSheVersion":"Edison told the truth.","TextTheyVersion":"Edison told the truth."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2000.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25133","byteOffset":17390512,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_13C9F6FB","articyId":"72057821671351043","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Edison might have a hidden agenda.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Edison might have a hidden agenda.","TextSheVersion":"Edison might have a hidden agenda.","TextTheyVersion":"Edison might have a hidden agenda."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2000.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26349","byteOffset":17849536,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DFr_7AD91702","articyId":"72057821671351057","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"If she exists...","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"If she exists...","TextSheVersion":"If she exists...","TextTheyVersion":"If she exists..."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1100.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40460","byteOffset":29634592,"byteLength":296}},{"id":"DFr_C7853B6D","articyId":"72057821671351064","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Mica says there is no niece.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Mica says there is no niece.","TextSheVersion":"Mica says there is no niece.","TextTheyVersion":"Mica says there is no niece."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1100.0,"y":150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17296","byteOffset":14432712,"byteLength":308}},{"id":"DFr_28345ADD","articyId":"72057821671351079","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"So Mica lied.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So Mica lied.","TextSheVersion":"So Mica lied.","TextTheyVersion":"So Mica lied."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2000.0,"y":25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25320","byteOffset":17463632,"byteLength":296}},{"id":"DFr_1A11C969","articyId":"72057821671351100","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"You don't hate that. You love it!","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You don't hate that. You love it!","TextSheVersion":"You don't hate that. You love it!","TextTheyVersion":"You don't hate that. You love it!"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2600.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29772","byteOffset":19144448,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DFr_89A186FF","articyId":"72057821671351121","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"So what do we do? How do we save the niece?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So what do we do? How do we save the niece?","TextSheVersion":"So what do we do? How do we save the niece?","TextTheyVersion":"So what do we do? How do we save the niece?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3200.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50413","byteOffset":33413192,"byteLength":324}},{"id":"DFr_6BAD342E","articyId":"72057821671351137","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Who do I have to screw over?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Who do I have to screw over?","TextSheVersion":"Who do I have to screw over?","TextTheyVersion":"Who do I have to screw over?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3800.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36282","byteOffset":28072504,"byteLength":308}},{"id":"DFr_300A1D56","articyId":"72057821671351144","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Who do I have to kill?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Who do I have to kill?","TextSheVersion":"Who do I have to kill?","TextTheyVersion":"Who do I have to kill?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3800.0,"y":150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33498","byteOffset":20556152,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_C792F43D","articyId":"72057821671351159","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Are you serious?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Are you serious?","TextSheVersion":"Are you serious?","TextTheyVersion":"Are you serious?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4400.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22056","byteOffset":16230960,"byteLength":296}},{"id":"DFr_3808D420","articyId":"72057821671351165","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Go ahead!","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Go ahead!","TextSheVersion":"Go ahead!","TextTheyVersion":"Go ahead!"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4400.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36504","byteOffset":28155688,"byteLength":292}},{"id":"DFr_6DF90FCA","articyId":"72057821671351171","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Never! I won't do that.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Never! I won't do that.","TextSheVersion":"Never! I won't do that.","TextTheyVersion":"Never! I won't do that."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4400.0,"y":25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"52014","byteOffset":34092728,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_0CCE6D89","articyId":"72057821671351241","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Freya is ruthless. She would kill Mica.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Freya is ruthless. She would kill Mica.","TextSheVersion":"Freya is ruthless. She would kill Mica.","TextTheyVersion":"Freya is ruthless. She would kill Mica."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5300.0,"y":200.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20423","byteOffset":15608800,"byteLength":320}},{"id":"DFr_246C833A","articyId":"72057821671351263","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I'm not sure about this.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm not sure about this.","TextSheVersion":"I'm not sure about this.","TextTheyVersion":"I'm not sure about this."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5950.0,"y":125.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29175","byteOffset":18918936,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_70D6622C","articyId":"72057821671351270","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"There's really no other way?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"There's really no other way?","TextSheVersion":"There's really no other way?","TextTheyVersion":"There's really no other way?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5950.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30732",